cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Kidney PBPK model of furosemide and protein-bound uremic toxins"
abstract: >-
  Mechanistic kidney physiologically based pharmacokinetic (PBPK) model of
  furosemide and the protein-bound uremic toxins indoxyl sulfate, hippuric
  acid and p-cresyl sulfate, with competitive inhibition of OAT1-mediated
  tubular uptake by furosemide, for healthy and CKD stage 5 conditions.
authors:
