    given-names: Leyla
    affiliation: "Maastricht Centre for Systems Biology (MaCSBio), Faculty of Science and Engineering, Maastricht University, Maastricht, The Netherlands"
date-released: 2026-10-21
keywords:
  - PBPK
  - kidney
  - chronic kidney disease
  - uremic toxins
  - furosemide
  - OAT1
  - drug-toxin interaction
